    "long_instructions": "## Design Your Music App\r\n\r\nUse what you designed in the previous level to build a web app to displaying your music playlist or card view.\r\n\r\n_Hint: Create your HTML and CSS files first. Then make sure that `script.js` loops through the data found in `data.json`._\r\n\r\nWhen you finish, upload your files `index.html`, `styles.css`, and `script.js` to your backpack. You'll need these as a starting point for the next level.",
